WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.570
Yes, hello.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:37.480
Cat Café
Granada

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:39.180
What is it, Inaba-san?

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:39.560
Cat Café
Granada

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.240
Aren't you off today?

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.910
What? You arrested the goat?

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.230
Oh, that's good.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.920
Please
Come
Again
Meow

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:01.010
Where the hell did that sudden
arrest report come from?!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:06.020
FILE:11 Don Valentino Jailbreak Case

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:06.890
Police HQ

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.980
What do you mean?!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.310
You're skipping the detaining
and confinement

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.450
and sending him straight to prison?!

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:12.480
Calm down, Hiroshi.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.760
How am I supposed to remain calm?!

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:15.760
I understand.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.850
Valentino is indeed a mafia boss and a villain,

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.910
but he should also have the right to a fair trial.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.750
Am I wrong, Commissioner?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.690
Have you both forgotten?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.220
Before he is a villain...

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:35.880
He is a goat.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:43.790
How'd it go, Inaba-san?

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:44.770
It's no use.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:46.600
They won't tell me where the goat is.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:51.060
They mentioned there was a prison
for those who aren't human.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.060
He's definitely locked up,
but something doesn't feel right.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.550
I didn't know there was such a place.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.160
Isn't it the zoo?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.700
This prison, Alcamone, is not under
any country's jurisdiction,

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.200
and the island itself has
been erased from existence.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.880
Meaning, no nation's laws are effective here.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.840
Humans do not exist here!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.040
It is a completely deserted island.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.900
Don't think you're going to
be treated like a human.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.520
You are just a goat!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.520
The word "compassion" doesn't exist in
the AI brains of us guard robots!

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.580
We have no reservations about
dousing you with boiling water!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.860
You're a hot water dispenser, you are.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.320
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.060
Any form of currency
means nothing here.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:45.280
Meaning, you're penniless.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.340
You will get points for
any work done here,

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.500
so work hard.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.960
To use and receive points,
we need your identification.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.450
Hurry and record your fingerprints.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:03:59.920
Fingerprints?

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:03.010
Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Fingerprint, palm print, face print,
voice print, retinas, DNA...

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.760
Goat or not, you have to have
one of them, so cough it up!
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.640
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.510
Look, it's Valentino.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.550
So they finally caught him, too.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.070
He <i>is</i> a goat, just like the rumor said.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.280
I'm the only one in stripes?!

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.210
This is your cell.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.930
There is a human, there is.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.980
Dinner is in five minutes.
Wait in your cell until then.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.130
But you said there were no humans.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:45.520
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.350
Shut up! Quit complaining and
just wait in your cell!
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.770
My name is Don Valentino.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.080
What is your name?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.360
Hey, can you not speak?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.620
My name is Don Valentino, it is.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.990
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.120
I am clean, I am! I do not smell!

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.790
You smell nostalgic.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.160
My name is Akiyoshi.
Pleasure to meet you, Don.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.530
R-Right...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.570
It's time for dinner!

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.830
Proceed to the cafeteria at once!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.350
What is the matter, Akiyoshi?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.920
We should hurry and go, we should.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:33.850
Go on ahead.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.890
I've got a bad leg, so I walk slowly.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.400
There's no reason to hurry.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:45.150
Field Guide to Plants

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.050
Your stomach was grumbling.
Field Guide to Plants

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:46.650
Your stomach was grumbling.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.340
You're just hearing things, you are.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.040
Yo, Valentino.

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:58.920
You're Lee, one of the heads of
the Chinese mafia, you are!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.400
You should be dead, you should.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.270
So that's what they're saying, huh?

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.050
As you can see, I'm doing great.

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:07.350
Must be nice rooming with Akiyoshi.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:09.550
He can't talk, so it must be nice and quiet.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.370
That makes it sounds like I'm noisy.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.420
Give me a break, sir.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:17.740
Your snoring is quite bad, too.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.410
To think how many sleepless
nights I've had...

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.930
What'd you say?

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.830
Be careful what you say.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.320
Who do you think I am?

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.180
That was wasteful, Akiyoshi.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.990
Make sure you pick it up and eat it.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.200
Thomas again, eh?

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.730
He's the little one who gets
his thrills by bullying the weak.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.230
Pay no attention to him.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.750
You again, Akiyoshi?!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.450
Hurry and clean it up!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:48.520
Stop, you will!
Akiyoshi is not at fault!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.140
Shut up!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.390
Those who talk back will
get hot water, too!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.020
Akiyoshi!

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.950
Sorry, Don.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.280
I guess we didn't get to eat.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.260
Who cares about that?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.690
Why won't you say anything?!

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.030
You should tell the koala and

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.710
the guard what they deserve, you should!

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.780
Sorry. It's a habit that I can
only speak in front of my boss.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.620
Your boss?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.070
But I wonder why it is...

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.120
I didn't even want to talk
to anyone else before,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.270
but I have no problem
talking in front of you.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:25.230
All right! Then I will become
your new boss, I will!

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.200
You will?

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.500
Eventually, my family will
come rescue me, they will.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.220
I will take you with me, I will.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.420
So you believe in your subordinates.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.860
I hope my boss will be
influenced by you, too.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.080
From what you said,

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.950
it sounds like your boss
is a man of poor caliber.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:47.770
He sounds like that beast,
the wolf, he does!

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:49.900
Don...

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.870
Actually, compared to you,
he might be a man of poor caliber.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:59.190
So many people rely on him that
he can't rely on his subordinates.

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:02.290
He's pretty ostentatious,
and quite a troublesome boss.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.070
I'm so sorry, Akiyoshi!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.090
I ate your book, I did!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.070
Good morning, Don.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.350
Hello!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:25.310
Oh, you did.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.500
You're quite the eater.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.770
I can't believe I did such a thing...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.190
Don't worry about it.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.160
Getting no dinner yesterday
must have been hard.

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.260
You are a good person,
you are, Akiyoshi.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:42.380
I hear that a lot.

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:44.760
Oh, you.

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:46.170
So you like books?

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.330
I like the smell of books.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.130
You are an odd one, you are.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.950
I like how they taste, I do.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.030
That's even more odd, I'd say.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.310
You work really hard, Don.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.900
I'm going to rack up points and
repay you for your book, I am.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.150
Don't worry about it.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.090
Thank you.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.360
It's been pretty fun every day
since you got here, Don.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.580
I could say the same, I could.

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:18.270
Akiyoshi.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:21.060
Even if your boss doesn't believe in you,

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.500
and you don't believe in yourself,

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.620
I believe in you, I do.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.510
You are part of my family, you are.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.290
They are quite late, they are.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:40.920
What are Noah, Gabriella,
and Lorenzo all doing?

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.980
I've been a well-behaved
prisoner, I have.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.810
You may be able to get parole first.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:48.500
I wonder if a don can get parole...

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:58.640
Are you all right, Akiyoshi?

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.070
Akiyoshi!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.700
Apparently, 140 degrees isn't
hot enough for you!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:07.580
So this is what you do to a book we
lent you from the prison library...

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:11.170
Look at how destroyed it is!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.000
That's not true! I'm the one who—

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:15.590
I'm terribly sorry.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:16.920
Too late.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.950
I'm already boiling. Come with me.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.250
Wait, you will!

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.010
What are you going to do to Akiyoshi?!

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.730
I wonder.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.440
I guess you'll find out after the dechlorination.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.330
Akiyoshi!

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.570
It's a nice, cool breeze, isn't it?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.830
Wait right there for a while.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:53.500
What? Do you have a cold?
You have a fever, too...

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.010
I guess I won't do it today...

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.550
Just kidding!

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.280
When I get serious,
I put out 212 degrees!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.160
You're cold, aren't you?
Warm up to your heart's content!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:13.010
You should sleep out here tonight,
and hopefully, you'll die by morning.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.610
Come on, show me your face.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.480
I'll make sure I get it into your mouth.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.160
Soumei-san...

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:30.660
Ow...

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.570
And it's cold.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:36.810
What the hell were you
doing with my vessel?!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.180
With the goat gone, he just
became an outer shell!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.300
I just wanted to try something new!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.190
The goat has nothing to do with it!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.640
Oh, just admit you're lonely...

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.810
All right, we're here.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:56.490
Everyone ready?

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:57.910
Don! Don!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:01.640
Soumei-san went for reconnaissance
and hasn't come back yet.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:03.210
Don! Don!
I wonder if something happened?

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:03.380
Don! Don!

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.520
Shut up.
Don! Don!

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.780
We're going to make our descent.
Don!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.470
We're going to make our descent.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:11.660
Don!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.060
This isn't good.
He's not in good shape at all.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:23.000
How dare you fight back, Akiyoshi...

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.810
Crack-a-Lack

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.230
It doesn't hurt!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.070
It doesn't hurt at all
because of Don power!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.420
All right, we're all good.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.700
Hey. You've got intruders.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.190
What'd you come here f—

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.240
You're in my way!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.660
Death to all who block my road to the Don!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.820
Without the Don,
we're on the verge of death!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.490
We are comrades!

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:51.000
Everyone loves the Don!

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.220
You could cook rice in that...

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.800
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.380
It's me, Soumei! Help!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.630
What? Did you forget?

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:10.010
He was the vessel before Yataro.
He's your predecessor.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.320
Akiyoshi-san...?

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:16.550
He hasn't aged at all...

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.110
Search that guard and get me
the key, and his clothes.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.080
It's cold.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:26.440
I didn't think I'd find Akiyoshi
in a place like this.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.070
No wonder I couldn't find him even
when I searched all over Japan.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.470
Nacchan, you can look now.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.820
You could have looked
this whole time, actually.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.290
I decline.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.960
Jeez, what kind of face is that?

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.630
To Yata, he's the one who raised him.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.120
Of course he's happy.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.480
Oh, I guess you're right.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.900
As much as I'd like to
give him a reunion hug,

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.580
we can't just stand here.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.840
I want to hear what Akiyoshi
has to say, so I'm getting out.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.530
Natsuki-chan?

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:02.710
Yes.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:03.670
Yataro-kun?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.830
Oh, my gosh!
You two have grown <i>so</i> much!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.510
You used to be <i>this</i> small!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:10.640
Do you remember me?

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:13.320
Oh, gosh. This just means
I've gotten that much older!

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:14.130
What the heck?

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:16.330
He's like some aunt you
haven't seen in years...

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.830
You've gotten so much
taller, Yataro-kun!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.630
I think you're taller than me now.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.800
Look at you with your glasses!
You look so cool now.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.800
Are you all right, Natsuki-chan?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.610
Soumei-san isn't being
too demanding, is he?

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.500
Sorry, I know he can be
a troublesome boss...

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.760
Who are you, their mom?!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.350
Soumei-san, when did you...

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:36.620
Even vessels get surprised
if you take over

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.490
without warning, so don't do that!

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.570
Oh, I'm sorry. Habit...
Wait, hell with that!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:42.370
You're going to break
out of here with us.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.360
I cannot.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.940
I will remain here.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.520
I haven't finished investigating here yet.

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:53.720
Your body might be here in Alcamone.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.400
It's not here.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:56.800
You shouldn't be so certain.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:57.540
Enough!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:58.080
What do you think would've happened
to you if I hadn't shown up?!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.190
Soumei-san!

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.510
What do you think would've happened
to you if I hadn't shown up?!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:01.960
Like hell I'll leave you here!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.550
This is an order.
You're coming with me.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.560
You are troublesome.
So quick to bare your fangs.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.670
You should be able to sway

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.020
the heart of your subordinate
with your charisma.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:24.860
Come back. I need you.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.470
Yes. That's all you needed to do.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.700
But I'm still not going back.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.640
Are you a demon?!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.530
Akiyoshi-san is such a beast tamer...

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.270
Enough! I'm going over there!

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:41.040
We're going to regroup with the goat

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.620
and get the hell out of here!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.820
He's going to be mad at you again.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:45.810
Shut up! Like I care!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.510
Don!

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:53.030
Your Lorenzo is right here! Don!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:53.400
Shut up! Let me concentrate!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.550
Don!
Shut up! Let me concentrate!

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:55.380
Don!

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:56.200
Don! Don! Don!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:59.060
I can feel his presence...
Don! Don! Don!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.290
Don! Don! Don!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.030
The Don is definitely here...
Don! Don! Don!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:09.960
There!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:11.900
Don!

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.310
Let's go, Lorenzo!

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.240
Did you really...
Did you really need to shoot him?!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.540
Don!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.500
Lorenzo!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.730
Don!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.320
Do not come through! Do not come through!

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.140
Just wait a little longer!

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.270
We've come to save you.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.430
I'm saved, I am...

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:44.140
Akiyoshi! We need to
find Akiyoshi, we do!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.570
He's going back with us, he is!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:45.790
Akiyoshi? Who is that?
He's going back with us, he is!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.280
Akiyoshi? Who is that?

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.440
If we take too long,
they'll cordon off the island.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.900
There they are!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.110
How dare you infiltrate the island?!
We'll stick you in a ce—

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.300
Shut the hell up!
Can't you see I'm talking here?!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:00.690
Akiyoshi! Akiyoshi! Where are you?

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.120
Hey, Akiyoshi!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.060
Don Valentino.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:07.290
Take me with you!
I'm sure I'll be useful.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.420
Akiyoshi! Akiyoshi!
Akiyoshi! Akiyoshi!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.660
Akiyoshi won't be of any use to you!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:17.920
I would have hidden the book better!
The bed was too easy.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.360
How do you know where the book was?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.940
Are you the rat, Thomas?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.460
I will let you out, as you wished.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.860
You who have wronged my family...

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.360
It's a fight!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.570
Get 'em!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.220
The family and guards
will stay out of this.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.190
Prepare yourself.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.710
My hooves are a bit hard, they are.

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.800
Better not underestimate me too much.

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:54.170
On the outside, I was known
as Eucalyptus Thomas.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.930
You think I'd be scared of some hooves?

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.120
Shut up!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:58.960
Now you did it!

00:17:58.960 --> 00:17:59.680
You, too!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.490
You hit me first!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.420
What the hell...

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.940
I totally want to get this on video.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:14.150
How dare you be so mean to Akiyoshi?!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.900
Shut up, you... you...

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.910
So relaxing...

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:23.420
I lost my strength all of a sudden...

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:24.790
You've got a terrible fever!

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.050
Hang in there, Soumei-san!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:28.700
This isn't good...

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:31.900
I'm losing consciousness...

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.600
All right, and I'm back!

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.300
Why are you suddenly awake?!

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:41.050
Goat... Don! Let's hurry and go home!

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.810
Oh, there you are, Akiyoshi!

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:50.150
You're kidding...

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.100
Stop it...

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.860
Akiyoshi? What's the matter?

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.820
Why right now...?

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:01.990
A-Akiyo...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.910
A wolf?!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.000
Yata, switch!

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.640
Hold it! Do you plan on shooting us, too?!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.920
If that wolf is a part of your group, yeah.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.880
If he's not, point your guns at the wolf.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.840
Akiyoshi, tell me it isn't so...

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.820
You are not a wolf...

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.080
You are so kind...

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:32.020
There's no way you could
be a terrible wolf...

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.360
Akiyoshi...

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:43.470
Crap!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.710
Let's help them!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.860
Get away from Glasses, you wolf!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.540
I'm so sorry!
Please forgive me, Akiyoshi-sama!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:57.890
Please don't eat me!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.630
Don, now's our chance!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.260
Akiyoshi! Akiyoshi!

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:24.390
How dare you...

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.850
How dare you deceive me like that?!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.470
I despise...

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:40.710
I despise wolves, I do!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:42.690
We're going to be left behind!

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.340
Wha—  But...

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:47.600
Akiyoshi-san...

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:52.570
I'm sorry, Don, Soumei-san.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.480
It's so peaceful.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.420
So peaceful, and all it took was
for the goat to be gone.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:06.850
You sound much better after
shedding your skin so many times.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.370
I'm so glad you're back to
your usual hair fetish self.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.420
Close! Close! Close!
You're hovering too close!

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:19.040
Moron!

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.570
What the hell did you come for, ya goat?!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.590
That was a short-lived peace...

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:34.090
Akiyoshi-san!
I'll go get your book for you!

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:35.740
You just sit right here.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:37.880
Looks like Akiyoshi's got himself a minion.

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.740
It'll be harder to search now...

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:44.400
Hey! What's all the racket?!

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.800
What? Is it time to eat already?

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.960
I'm not a rice cooker!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:50.920
Oh, I guess I didn't put the rice in yet.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.390
Oh well, at least it's peaceful.
Oh, I guess I didn't put the rice in yet.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:53.750
Oh well, at least it's peaceful.

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:29.980
How could...

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:32.850
How could next week be
the final episode?!

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.550
What the hell?! Keep going, damn it!

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.520
We haven't made any more,
so we can't.

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.570
Oh, I guess you can't, then...
